{ color: #1a4fa0; }\n  .desc-red  { color: #c62026; }\n  /* ===== Avoid section ===== */\n  .avoid-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .avoid-list {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 170px;\n    height: 90px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    margin-right: 14px;\n    border: 3px solid #e8262b;\n    border-radius: 50% / 45%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #e8262b;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">去张家界<span class=\"red\">6次</span>整理<span class=\"red\">8千字</span>干货</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-title\">景点篇（含门票信息+景点介绍）</div>\n\n  <table class=\"main\">\n    <tr class=\"rowA\">\n      <td class=\"label\">五星<br>推荐<br>景点</td>\n      <td class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">1.张家界国家森林公园（门票：225）</span><span class=\"desc-red\">必去景点，门票可玩4天</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">2.哈利路亚山（门票：免费）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">阿凡达取景地，一定要去打卡</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">3.鬼谷栈道（门票：免费）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">在天门山景点内，立在万丈悬崖边上</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">4.玻璃栈道（门票：免费）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">天门山内，悬于峭壁之上，勇敢者的游戏</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">5.十里画廊（门票：免费）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">两侧风景很美，到了张家界一定要去</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">6.金鞭溪（门票：免费）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">有很多野生猴子，自然的自己吃食哦</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">7.黄龙洞（门票：100）</span><span class=\"desc-red\">有世界溶洞全能冠军称号，可以去看看</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">8.天门山国家森林公园（门票：275）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">天门洞、空中寺庙、盘山公路</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">9.大峡谷玻璃桥（门票：138）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">全国玻璃桥的鼻祖，很长很刺激</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">10.张家界大峡谷（门票：118）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">一线天天梯栈道、三叠游道、瀑布中</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">11.猛洞河漂流（门票：180）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">夏天去漂流最是刺激好玩</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">12.凤凰古城（门票：免费）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">沈从文笔下的小镇，很幽静很美</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">13.芙蓉镇（门票：108）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">称“挂在瀑布上的千年古镇”</span></div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"rowB\">\n      <td class=\"label\">三星<br>推荐</td>\n      <td class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">1.宝峰湖景区（门票：96）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">世界自然遗产，被称为“世界湖泊经典”</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">2.溪布街（门票：免费）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">复合型旅游商业步行街，民族文化殿堂</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">3.魅力湘西表演（门票：228）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">第一次看还是很震撼的</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">4.土家风情园（门票：80）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">人文景观与自然景观相融合的地方</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">5.张家界五雷山（门票：63）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">湖南省首批确定的重点宗教场所</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">6.奇梁洞（门票：60）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">以“奇、秀、幽、峻”四大特色著称</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">7.中国南方长城（门票：45）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">苗疆边墙，是中国古代的军事防御工程</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">8.龙王洞（门票：60）</span><span class=\"desc-blue\">被溶洞专家称赞为“世界溶洞奇葩</span></div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"rowC\">\n      <td class=\"label\">避坑<br>景点</td>\n      <td class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"avoid-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"avoid-list\">\n            1.张家界千古情（×）<br>\n            2.田家老院子（×）<b